{"id":"000VNL","title":"Parity Fun 53","author":"galium_odoratum","solvedCount":0,"difficulty":2,"rating":"N/A","firstSeen":"2026-10-31T09:45:34+00:00","posted":"Heute, 10:00 Uhr","rules":"More classic rules with a small parity twist. Have fun!\n\nNormal Sudoku rules apply.\n\nGerman Whisper: Adjacent digits along a green line must differ by at least 5.\n\nX: Digits separated by an X must sum to 10.\n\nThermometers: Digits along a thermometer must strictly increase from the bulb to the tip.\n\nCages: Digits in a cage must sum to the number shown in its top-left corner.\n\nFog: Some clues are hidden by fog, which lifts as needed during the solve. No guessing is required.\n\nConstant Parity Clues: All digits belonging to clues of the same type must share the same parity (odd or even) across the entire puzzle. For example, if one digit on a German Whisper line is odd, then all digits on all German Whisper lines must be odd. Different clue types may have different parities.\n\nPlay on SudokuPad\n\nTry out the others of this series:\n\nParity Fun 40\n\nParity Fun 41\n\nParity Fun 42\n\nParity Fun 43\n\nParity Fun 44\n\nParity Fun 45\n\nParity Fun 46\n\nParity Fun 47\n\nParity Fun 48\n\nParity Fun 49\n\nParity Fun 50\n\nParity Fun 51\n\nParity Fun 52","solutionCode":"Row 6","tags":["Sudoku","Thermometer","XV (Variante)","Killer (Variante)","German Whispers (Variante)"],"links":[{"url":"https://sudokupad.app/uf0b6zhj3h","kind":"sudokupad"}],"data":"","error":null,"settings":{},"link":"https://sudokupad.app/uf0b6zhj3h","linkKind":"sudokupad","summary":{"format":"scl","decoded":true,"rows":9,"cols":9,"cages":3,"hasSolution":true,"features":["lines","overlays","underlays"]},"attempts":0,"fetched":"2026-10-31T09:45:34+00:00"}